    "figarch_d": 0.6100199252546504,
    "interpretation": "GARCH persistence=0.9754 (near IGARCH). FIGARCH d=0.6100 confirms long memory. Standard GARCH likely inflates persistence to mimic long-memory decay (Hillebrand 2005 / Baillie et al. 1996). True vol dynamics are fractionally integrated, not exponentially decaying."
  },
